WEBVTT

00:04:27.831 --> 00:04:30.747
Or something bad happens
that's not part of the original plan:

00:04:30.771 --> 00:04:32.511
a cancer scare or they lose a child,

00:04:32.535 --> 00:04:34.043
and they're down in the valley.

00:04:34.067 --> 00:04:37.849
And in the valley, they realize they're
much deeper than they thought they were.

00:04:37.873 --> 00:04:39.621
There's a great Paul Tillich line --

00:04:39.645 --> 00:04:42.324
moments of suffering,
when we have these valleys in life,

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:44.903
they remind us we're not
the person we thought we are.

00:04:44.927 --> 00:04:47.896
They carve through what we thought
was the basement of our soul

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.314
and reveal a cavity below that
and carve below that

00:04:50.338 --> 00:04:51.828
and reveal a cavity below that.

00:04:51.852 --> 00:04:53.672
And we realize we're just much deeper,

00:04:53.696 --> 00:04:57.000
and only spiritual and emotional food
is going to fill those cavities.

00:04:57.024 --> 00:05:00.450
And when you make that discovery
about yourself, what you really desire,